<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>痘疹门 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E7%97%98%E7%96%B9%E9%97%A8/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 29 Jun 2026 09:59:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E7%97%98%E7%96%B9%E9%97%A8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>张真人传痘疹门</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/posts/5-33-douzhenmen/</link><pubDate>Mon, 29 Jun 2026 09:55:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://lruihao.cn/posts/5-33-douzhenmen/</guid><category domain="https://lruihao.cn/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“张真人传痘疹门”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;张仲景真人&lt;/strong&gt;传授痘疮（天花）与疹症（麻疹）的治疗方药及加减法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;小儿宜补不宜散。痘疮以补气补血、托毒外出为主，疹症以补血清热、透发为要。今传三方治痘，一方治疹，随症加减，神而通之，可称神医&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>